flowchart TD
    A[User message] --> B{Orchestrator: which path?}

    B -->|crisis| C[Fixed crisis response]
    B -->|direct answer| D[LLM only - no tools]
    B -->|search database| E{Which corpus?}
    B -->|web search| F[External web lookup]
    B -->|structured query| G[Query profile / mood logs]
    B -->|document extraction| H[Parse uploaded files]

    E -->|clinical KB| I[Retrieve clinical documents]
    E -->|journal entries| J[Retrieve user journal entries]
    E -->|both| K[Retrieve from both corpora]

    I --> L[Retrieval strategy: rank and select]
    J --> L
    K --> L

    L --> M[Generate reply]
    D --> M
    F --> M
    G --> M
    H --> M
